# Copy to .env (it's gitignored) and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Only secrets go here; the team's settings (engines, models, slots, timeouts) are in nextlevel.json.
# Workers never see these values.

# Phone notifications from the team and the daily report (https://ntfy.sh). The topic name works
# like a password: make it long and random, e.g. the output of
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(24).toString('hex'))"
NTFY_TOPIC=

# The project's own secrets (API keys, passwords) go below.
